    "adapt": "The harbour wholesale warehouse (Garage_E_02, 28 x 19 m, one big ground-floor hall with truck bays all round, a mezzanine over the east end that stays). The kit shows the same model as the host, so its offsets are in the building's own frame, front +z. The buyer's counter stands mid-hall facing the front bays, the clerk behind it and the chalk price board beside it; planks and logs stack along the west wall, ore bins and a barrel row along the back wall, cement and iron on pallets on the east side; work lights hang over the bays. Rows are rigid: shift, never stretch."
